\title{bambamR: RNA-Seq Processing from FASTQ Files to Publication-Ready Plots}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.svg}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

A streamlined toolkit for RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) analysis covering FASTQ and BAM import, quality control, alignment through external aligners ('STAR', 'HISAT2', 'minimap2'), read counting, normalization, differential expression analysis with 'DESeq2', 'edgeR' or 'limma', and publication-ready visualizations including oncoplots, volcano plots, heatmaps and principal component analysis plots. Works in a minimal mode with dependencies from CRAN only, or in a full mode when the optional 'Bioconductor' packages are installed.
